    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional Detached Dormer Residence on 0.23 Hectares (0.56 Acres)\n\nSet amidst beautifully tranquil countryside, this exceptional detached dormer bungalow offers an outstanding blend of elegance, space, and modern family living. Meticulously maintained and presented in impeccable condition, the home exudes quality and attention to detail throughout.\n\nThe thoughtfully designed layout provides both comfort and versatility. On the first floor, three generously proportioned bedrooms include a luxurious principal suite with a private ensuite, complemented by a beautifully appointed family bathroom.\n\nThe ground floor is equally impressive, featuring an additional bedroom ideal for guests, alongside a stunning open-plan kitchen, dining, and living space that forms the heart of the home—perfect for both everyday living and sophisticated entertaining. Additional reception spaces include an elegant family room, a dedicated playroom, and a private home office, offering flexibility to suit a variety of lifestyles. A stylish guest WC and a well-equipped utility room complete the accommodation.\n\nOccupying a generous and private site, the property enjoys a serene rural setting without compromising on convenience. Located just 4km from Oldcastle, residents have easy access to an excellent range of amenities including boutique shops, reputable schools, charming cafés, and quality restaurants.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a home of distinction in a truly idyllic setting."
      },
